 <link linkend="org.osgi.service.typedevent.UntypedEventHandler">UntypedEventHandler</link> service.
 </para>
      <para>
 This annotation can be used on a component to declare the values of the
 <link linkend="org.osgi.service.typedevent.TypedEventConstants.TYPED_EVENT_TOPICS">TypedEventConstants.TYPED_EVENT_TOPICS</link> service property.</para>
