               role="method"
               xml:id="org.osgi.service.typedevent.propertytypes.EventTopics.value--">
         <title>String[] value</title>
         <para role="description">
Service property specifying the <code>Event</code> topics of interest to an
 <link linkend="org.osgi.service.typedevent.TypedEventHandler">TypedEventHandler</link> or <link linkend="org.osgi.service.typedevent.UntypedEventHandler">UntypedEventHandler</link> service.
